  \retailDemo\securityText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria he pēhea te roa o te haere o RDX i mua i te tango i te urunga ki te pūkete whakahaere. Kia oti te uru te tango, e kore e taea e koe ngā hōtuhi te whakahaere, te kawe rānei i ētahi atu taumahi whakahaere. Ki te hiahia koe kia haere tonu te uru kaiwhakahaere, ka taea te hanga kupuhipa whakahaere ritenga. Āta titiro he tino haumaru rawa atu tō kupuhipa ritenga.
