  \oobeWelcome\LaunchNarratorInstruction:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kia tatū tāu pūrere mā te whakamahi tētahi pūpānui mata, whakakāngia a Pūpānui mā te pēhi a Windows + Control + Enter. Mō ētahi atu o ngā āhuahira urutanga, pēhi a Windows + U, tīpako rānei te ata Urutanga kei te kokonga i raro.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro5VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ok, enough intro. Let’s dig in.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro4VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: If you need an assistive screen reader, press the Windows, Control, and Enter keys at the same time to turn on Narrator.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro3VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Use your voice or the keyboard along the way, and if you’d like me to stay quiet, just select the little microphone icon towards the bottom of your screen.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro2VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: A little sign-in here, a touch of Wi-Fi there, and we’ll have your PC ready for all you plan to do.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro1VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hi there! I’m Cortana, and I’m here to help.
  \oobeWelcome\CortanaAnimationAccString:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ko Cortana tēnei e Kōrero nei
  \oobeUpdateSettings\UpdateSettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kia noho haumaru ki ngā whakahōutanga
  \oobeUpdateSettings\UpdateSettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakahōu auau ai tō pūrere kia ronaki ai kia haumaru ai te whakahaere, me tau koe i ngā āhuahira hōu kia noho huhua ake āu mahi whakawhiti pūrere koe. Kōwhiria ō tautuhinga whakahōu, ka tīpako i ngā Tūtohu hei tiaki. Ka taea te huri ō tautuhinga i ngā wā katoa.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\SettingNarratorDescriptionFormatString:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: %1 rēreti i %2.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako i ētahi atu mea mō ēnei tautuhinga
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader3:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me pēhea te huri i ngā tautuhinga whakahōu mō ngā taupānga Microsoft Store
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader2:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me pēhea te huri i ngā tautuhinga whakahōu mō te Windows Update
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader1:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ngā whakahōunga aunoa mō ngā taupānga Windows me te Microsoft Store
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīpakona 'Ako atu anō' mō ngā mōhiohio i ngā tautuhinga ki runga.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako i ētahi atu mea
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody3:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea te huri ō tautuhinga whakahōu i ngā wā katoa mā te toro ki te Microsoft Store > Tirohia ētahi atu > Ngā Tautuhinga.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea te huri ō tautuhinga whakahōu i ngā wā katoa mā te toro ki Ngā Tautuhinga > Whakahōu me te Haumarutanga > Windows Update > kōwhiringa arā atu Anō.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody1:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka āwhina ngā whakahōu auau pare i tō pūrere me te pupuri tonu kia ronaki ai kia haumaru ai. Mēnā ka kōwhiri koe ki te tiki ngā whakahōu aunoa, ka tikiake e rātou ki tō pūrere ina reira i te wātea nā ngā wā katoa i a koe te tapi haumarutanga me te whakarei, pēnei i ngā whakahōu Pūkaro Microsoft, ngā atekōkiri, me ngā pūmanawa mārō hōu rawa. Ki te kore koe e tiki whakahōutanga aunoa, ka taki tonu e Microsoft i tō pūrere mō ngā whakahōu e wātea ana. Ka whakamōhio mātou ētahi wā ina e wātea ana ngā whakahōu hōu. Ka kātahi ka kōwhiri koe mēnā ka, kāore rānei ki te tikiake i ngā whakahōu, engari e kore e tino oti te whakahōu me te pare ā-kia mutu rā anō koe te tikiake me te tāuta.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\CustomizeVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakahōu auau i tō pūrere ka āwhina te rere. Kōwhiri mēnā ka hiahia e koe ki te tiki ngā whakahōu aunoa o ngā taupānga Windows me te Microsoft Store, ā, ka tīpako "Whakaae."
  \oobeUpdateSettings\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Haere tonu
  \oobeSettings\SettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ngā tautuhinga tūmataitinga mō tō pūrere
  \oobeSettings\SettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me Microsoft ko koe te rangatira o tō tūmataitinga. Kōwhiria ō tautuhinga, ka tīpako <b>Whakaae</b> hei tiaki ēnei. Me huri ēnei tautuhinga ina pai koe.
  \oobeSettings\SettingNarratorDescriptionFormatString:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: %1 rēreti i %2.
  \oobeSettings\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Panuku
  \oobeSettings\NextButtonAccLabel:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Nā, ripa mā ngā tautuhinga tūmataitinga katoa kia haere tonu
  \oobeSettings\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Te āhua nei he raruraru tūhono tā tātou - kāore pea koe i te tūhono ki te ipurangi, he raruraru rānei i tēnei pito i a mātou. Ka taea e koe te pānui i te Tauākī Tūmataitinga Microsoft ahakoa te wā mā te pato i te aka.ms/privacy ki te pae wāhitau o tētahi pūtirotiro o tētahi pūrere ahakoa he aha.
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako i ētahi atu mea mō ēnei tautuhinga
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīpako <b>Ako atu anō</b> mō ngā mōhiohio mō ngā tautuhinga o runga ake nei, mō te pēheatanga o tā Windows āwhina ki te pare i a koe i ngā taupānga me ngā ihirangi tukutuku haumaru kore, me ngā whakawhitinga raraunga whai pānga me ngā whakamahinga.
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ākona mai anō
  \oobeSettings\CustomizeVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Koinei ngā tautuhinga e manakohia ana e Microsoft. Haere tonu ka arokitea, ka tīpako i "Whakaae" kia rite mai koe.
  \oobeSettings\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Haere tonu
  \oobeSettings\AcceptButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae
  \oobeSettings\AcceptButtonAccLabel:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae ki ngā tautuhinga tūmataitinga katoa
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TelemetryVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Next, choose whether or not you want to help Microsoft diagnose and fix issues.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TailoredVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: If you want tips, offers, and suggestions that are tailored to you, just select Accept.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\SettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ngā tautuhinga tūmataitinga mō tō pūrere
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Te āhua nei he raruraru tūhono tā tātou - kāore pea koe i te tūhono ki te ipurangi, he raruraru rānei i tēnei pito i a mātou. Ka taea e koe te pānui i te Tauākī Tūmataitinga Microsoft ahakoa te wā mā te pato i te aka.ms/privacy ki te pae wāhitau o tētahi pūtirotiro o tētahi pūrere ahakoa he aha.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\MultiSettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ō tautuhinga, kātahi ka tīpako <b>Whakaae</b> hei tiaki. Takina te hono <b>Ako atu anō</b> mō ngā mōhiohio mō ēnei tautuhinga, me pēhea te huri, he pēhea te āwhina a Windows ki te pare i a koe i ngā taupānga me ngā ihirangi tukutuku haumaru kore, me ngā whakawhitinga raraunga whai pānga me ngā whakamahinga.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LocationVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Now, choose if you want to let Microsoft and other apps use your location to help you with directions, weather, and more.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako i ētahi atu mea mō ēnei tautuhinga
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako i ētahi atu mea
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\InputDiagnosticsVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: And if you want to help improve language recognition and suggestions for apps and services that run on Windows, you can choose to do that here.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\FindMyDeviceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: And if you ever lose your device, here's where you get to choose if you want help finding it.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Haere tonu
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\AdsVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Last up for these settings, choose whether or not you want your ads to be more relevant to you.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\Title:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kohinga raraunga ka hiahiatia
  \oobeSettingsAadc\Subtitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He mea hira tō tūmataitinga, koirā e hiahia ai mātou kia mārama koe ki ngā raraunga e kohikohia ana e mātou.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubText2:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: E tohe ana a Microsoft ki te whakarato i te parenga tino pai rawa atu i ngā tuma mamati. Hei āwhina ki te whakaoti i tēnei, ka kohi mōhiohio te Mata Atamai Microsoft Defender me te Mana Taupānga Atamai mō ngā paetukutuku ka toro koe, ngā kōnae ka tikiake koe, me ngā taupānga ka tāuta, ka whakahaere koe. Ka whakamahia tēnei raraunga hei whakatūpato i a koe me te āwhina ki te pare i a koe, tō pūrere, me ō kupuhipa mai i ngā taupānga me ngā ihirangi tukutuku haumaru kore.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubText1:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka kohi mōhiohio a Microsoft mō tō pūrere, ōna tautuhinga, tōna āheinga, mēnā kei te tika hoki te mahi. Ko ngā raraunga tātaritanga hiahiatia te taumata raraunga tātaritanga iti rawa e hiahiatia kia noho tika ai tō pūrere, kia haumaru, kia mahi pai noa, kia meatia hoki ngā whakapai tika ki Windows.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubHeader2:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Parenga mai i ngā taupānga me ngā ihirangi tukutuku haumaru kore
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubHeader1:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ngā Raraunga tātari ka hiahiatia
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Te kohinga raraunga hiahiatia
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcNextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Panuku
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcLearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako Atu Anō
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcBodyText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka kohia e Microsoft te raraunga e hiahiatia kia noho whakahōu tō pūrere, haumaru, kia mahi tika hoki. Kei roto pea ko te mōhiohio mō ō kōnae, mō ngā tautuhinga taupānga, mō te tapi i ngā raruraru.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Panuku
  \oobeSettingsAadc\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Te āhua nei he raruraru tūhono tō tāua - kāore pea koe i te tūhono ki te ipurangi, he raruraru rānei kei tēnei taha. Ka taea e koe te pānui kōrero anō mō ngā raraunga tātaritanga ka Hiahiatia mā te pato i https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2162067 ki te pae wāhitau o te pūtirotiro i tētahi pūrere.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako anō mō te kohinga raraunga hiahiatia
  \oobeSettingsAadc\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako atu anō
  \oobeSettingsAadc\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Haere tonu
  \oobeRetailDemoExit\confirmTitle:
