  \oobeHello\HelloOptionBodyFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He pūoko tapukara tō tō pūrere ka mahi tahi me Windows Hello kia ngāwari ai tō takiuru haumaru ki tō matimati noa iho.
  \oobeHello\HelloMultiVoiceOver:
