  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreNavigationError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Te āhua nei he raruraru tūhono tā tātou - kāore pea koe i te tūhono ki te ipurangi, he raruraru rānei i tēnei pito i a mātou. Ka taea e koe te pānui i te Tauākī Tūmataitinga Microsoft ahakoa te wā mā te pato i te aka.ms/privacy ki te pae wāhitau o tētahi pūtirotiro o tētahi pūrere ahakoa he aha.
  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreLinkText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako atu anō mō te parenga pūkete
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He pūoko tapukara tō tāu pūrere ka mahi ngātahi me Windows Hello, e hua ai he tikanga kupuhipa-kore, ngāwari hoki hei manatoko i tō tuakiri.
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFace:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka mahi ngātahi tō kāmera me Windows Hello kia āhukahukatia koe, mā te hoatu i tētahi huarahi ngāwari, kupuhipa-kore hei manatoko i tō tuakiri.
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC with just your fingerprint. It's not only faster, it's more secure than a password. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ata tapukara Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Follow the instructions to teach your PC to read your fingerprints
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC, quick as a wink, with just your face. No wink required. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ata kanohi Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ok, hold still for a second. We need to learn to recognize you
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceAnimationAltText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hākoritanga kanohi Windows Hello
  \oobeHello\HelloContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Haere tonu
  \oobeHello\HelloButtonText:
