  \oobeCortana\setCortanaOptOut_newUwp:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore ināianei
  \oobeCortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakakāhore
  \oobeCortana\setCortanaOptIn:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae
  \oobeCortana\returnToMain:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: ĀE
  \oobeCortana\legalText_globalConsent:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hei tuku i a Cortana ki te whakarato i ngā wheako whaiaro me ngā huatau hāngai, ka kohi, ka whakamahi hoki a Microsoft, i ētahi mōhiohio tae atu ki tō tauwāhi me tō hītori tauwāhi, ō hoapā, tō reo tāuru, ō āhuatanga kōrero me te tuhi ā-ringa, tō hītori patopato, tō hītori rapu, ō taipitopito maramataka, tō hītori ihirangi me te whakawhiti kōrero mai i ngā ratonga Microsoft, ō karere me ō taupānga. Ki Microsoft Edge, kei te whakamahia e Cortana tō hītori tirotiro. E āhei ana koe i ngā wā katoa te panoni i aua kōwhiringa ki te Notebook me te whakakore i te mahi a Cortana i roto i Microsoft Edge.
  \oobeCortana\legalText_A:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hei āwhina i Cortana kia hora i ētahi wheako whaiaro me ngā huatau hāngai i roto i ngā hua Microsoft e tāpae nei i ngā wheako Cortana, i roto i tēnei pūrere hoki ina maukati tō pūrere, ka kohi ka whakamahi a Microsoft i  ngā mōhiohio, tae atu ki tō tauwāhi me tō hītori tauwāhi, tō tāurutanga reo, ō tikanga kōrero, ō hoapā, tō hītori rapu, ō whanaungatanga, ō taipitopito maramataka, tō īmēra, ō hītori ihirangi whakawhiti kōrero hoki i ngā  kuputuhi, ngā karere inamata me ngā taupānga, me ētahi atu mōhiohio i tō pūrere.<br/><br/>Ka taea tonutia e koe te huri i ngā mea ka maharatia e Cortana i roto i te Pukatuhipoka.
  \oobeCortana\legalText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hei āwhina i Cortana kia hora i ētahi wheako whaiaro me ngā huatau hāngai i roto i ngā hua Microsoft e tāpae nei i ngā wheako Cortana, i roto i tēnei pūrere hoki ina maukati tō pūrere, ka kohi ka whakamahi a Microsoft i  ngā mōhiohio, tae atu ki tō tauwāhi me tō hītori tauwāhi, tō tāurutanga reo, ō tikanga kōrero, ō hoapā, tō hītori rapu, ō whanaungatanga, ō taipitopito maramataka, tō īmēra, ō hītori ihirangi whakawhiti kōrero hoki i ngā  kuputuhi, ngā karere inamata me ngā taupānga, me ētahi atu mōhiohio i tō pūrere. I roto i Microsoft Edge, whakamahi ai Cortana i tō hītori tirotiro.<br/><br/> Heoi ka taea e koe te raweke ngā mea e maumaharatia e Cortana i roto i te Pukatuhipoka, me te mono i Cortana i roto i Microsoft Edge.
  \oobeCortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ākona mai anō
  \oobeCortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Cortana
  \oobeCortana\learnMoreBody_A:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ko Cortana tō kaiāwhina whaiaro. E tino pai rawa ai te mahinga o Cortana ina takiuru koe me waiho ia kia ako i ngā āhuatanga o ō mahi mā te whakamahi raraunga i tō pūrere, i tō pūkete Microsoft, i ngā ratonga hunga tuatoru me ētahi atu ratonga Microsoft. Hei āwhina i Cortana kia hora i ētahi wheako whaiaro me ngā huatau hāngai, ka taea e koe te waiho mā Microsoft e kohi, e whakamahi hoki ngā raraunga maha, pēnei i tō hītori tauwāhi, ngā taipitopito maramataka, ngā taupānga ka whakamahia e koe, ētahi raraunga mai i ō īmēra me ō kuputuhi, te hunga ka waeatia atu e koe, me te hunga e kōrero ngātahi ana koe i tō pūrere. Ina takiuru atu koe, ka ako hoki Cortana mōu mā te kohikohi raraunga mō te whakamahi i tō pūrere me ētahi atu ratonga Microsoft, pēnei i ō waiata, i ō tautuhinga pūoro, mehemea kei te kā te mata maukati, ngā mea ka tirohia ka hokona hoki e koe, tō hītori rapu Bing, me ētahi atu mea. Ka taea e koe te whakahaere i ngā raraunga ka whakamahia e Cortana, me ngā mea e mōhio ana a Cortana mōu i roto i Tautuhinga Cortana, Notebook me Whakaaetanga. Ka taea hoki e koe te takiputa i Cortana, ā, ina puta atu koe, hei reira tonu a Cortana hei āwhina i a koe, engari e kore ō wheako e whakawhaiarotia.
  \oobeCortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako i ētahi atu mea mō Cortana i te Tauākī Tūmataitinga (https://aka.ms/privacy) me te Ako Atu Anō mō  Cortana (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \oobeCortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ko Cortana tō kaiāwhina whaiaro. E tino pai rawa ai te mahinga o Cortana ina takiuru koe me waiho ia kia ako i ngā āhuatanga o ō mahi mā te whakamahi raraunga i tō pūrere, i tō pūkete Microsoft, i ngā ratonga hunga tuatoru me ētahi atu ratonga Microsoft. Hei āwhina i Cortana kia hora i ētahi wheako whaiaro me ngā huatau hāngai, ka taea e koe te wahi mā Microsoft e kohi, e whakamahia hoki ngā raraunga maha, pēnei i tō hītori tauwāhi, ngā taipitopito maramataka, ngā taupānga ka whakamahia e koe, ētahi raraunga mai i ō īmēra me ō kuputuhi, te hunga ka waeatia atu e koe, me te hunga e kōrero ngātahi ana koe i tō pūrere. Ina takiuru atu koe, ka ako hoki Cortana mōu mā te kohikohi raraunga mō te whakamahi i tō pūrere me ētahi atu ratonga Microsoft, pēnei i ō waiata, i ō tautuhinga pūoho, mehemea kei te kā te mata maukati, ngā mea ka tirohia ka hokona hoki e koe, ō hītori tirotiro hoki i Microsoft Edge, tō hītori rapu Bing, me ētahi atu mea. Ka taea e koe te whakahaere i ngā raraunga ka whakamahia e Cortana, me ngā mea e mōhio ana a Cortana mōu i roto i Tautuhinga Cortana, Notebook me Whakaaetanga. Ka taea hoki e koe te takiputa i Cortana, ā, ina puta atu koe, hei reira tonu a Cortana hei āwhina i a koe, engari e kore ō wheako e whakawhaiarotia.
  \oobeCortana\heyCortanaCheckboxTextUsesMoreBattery:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tuku i a Cortana kia urupare ki "Hey Cortana". Nui atu te pūhiko ka whakamahia e Cortana ia kā tēnei.
  \oobeCortana\heyCortanaCheckboxTextPluggedOnly:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tuku i a Cortana kia urupare ki "Hey Cortana". Nui atu te pūhiko ka whakamahia e Cortana ina kā tēnei. Ina tūhonotia tō pūrere, ka taea e Cortana te urupare ahakoa kei te moe tō pūrere.
  \oobeCortana\heyCortanaCheckboxText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tuku i a Cortana kia urupare ki "Hey Cortana"
