  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\Title:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He pūkete tēnei mō te tamaiti, mō te rangatahi rānei?
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\Subtitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mēnā āe, whakaarohia te takiuru mā te pūkete Microsoft. Ina takiuru ngā tamariki o te whānau mā te pūkete Microsoft, ka arotahitia ō rātou parenga tūmataitinga ki tō rātou pakeke. Ka āhei ngā mātua me ngā kaitiaki te tatū he rōpū whānau me Haumaru Whānau Microsoft.
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\Option2Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Waihangatia tētahi pūkete ki tēnei pūrere ki tētahi ingoa kaiwhakamahi me tētahi kupuhipa
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\Option2Header:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore e takiuru mā tētahi pūkete Microsoft
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\Option2Glyph:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: 
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\Option1Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Waihangatia tētahi pūkete Microsoft hei whiwhi parenga tūmataitinga aro-ki-te-pakeke ki tēnei pūrere
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\Option1Header:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Takiuru mā tētahi pūkete Microsoft
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\Option1Glyph:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: 
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\OobeeAadcAgeConfirmationLearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako Atu Anō
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\OobeAadcAgeConfirmationYesButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Āe
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\OobeAadcAgeConfirmationTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Momo pūkete
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\OobeAadcAgeConfirmationNoButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāo
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\OobeAadcAgeConfirmationBodyText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He pūkete tēnei mō te tamaiti, mō te rangatahi rānei?<br><br>Ina takiuru ngā mema whānau tamariki mā te pūkete Microsoft, ka whiwhi parenga tūmataitinga rātou e arotahi ki tō rātou pakeke. Ka āhei hoki ngā mātua me ngā kaitiaki te tatū rōpū whānau me Haumaru Whānau Microsoft. Mā te tatū rōpū whānau e noho haumaru tuihono te katoa, e noho ki te ora tūturu me ngā tepe wā mata, ngā tātari ihirangi, te tiringa tauwāhi, me ētahi atu mea.
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Panuku
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Te āhua nei he raruraru tūhono tō tāua - kāore pea koe i te tūhono ki te ipurangi, he raruraru rānei kei tēnei taha. Ka taea e koe te pānui kōrero anō mō te takiuru me te Pūkete Microsoft mā te pato https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2162068 ki te pae wāhitau o te pūtirotiro i tētahi pūrere.
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako anō mō te takiuru mā tētahi pūkete Microsoft
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako atu anō
  \oobeAadcAgeConfirmation\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Haere tonu
