  \errors\NoPinTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kua pā mai tētahi raru ā, kāore tō PIN i te wātea.
  \errors\NoPinText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea te tautuhi anō tō PIN mā te haere ki ngā Tautuhinga > ngā Pūkete > ngā kōwhiringa takiuru.
  \errors\NoNetworkVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: You will need the Internet for this. It does not look like you are connected to the Internet. Check your connection and try again.
  \errors\NoNetworkMsaTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me mātua whai Ipurangi koe mō tēnei.
  \errors\NoNetworkMsaText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Te āhua nei kāore koe i te tūhono ki te Ipurangi. Tākina tō hononga ka ngana anō ai.
  \errors\NavigationBlockedVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: We cannot open that page right now. For security reasons, you will need to visit the page from a browser or a different device.
  \errors\NavigationBlockedTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore e taea te whakatuwhera i taua whārangi ināianei tonu.
  \errors\NavigationBlockedText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mō ngā take haumarutanga, me toro ki te whārangi mai i tētahi pūtirotiro, tētahi pūrere kē rānei. Mēnā ki ō whakaaro kua eke koe ki tēnei whārangi nā tētahi hapa, kīia atu te kaitautoko hangarau mōhiohio o tō umanga kāore e taea e koe te uru ki {0}
  \errors\LocalAccount:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīpoka
  \errors\GenericVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Something went wrong. Please try again later.
  \errors\GenericMsaText:
