  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\TitleCancel:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Taihoa, he mea nui tēnei
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\Title:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kei te hiahia tō whakahaere ki Windows Hello
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\Timestamp:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Waitohuwā:
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\SpecialErrorInfo:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mō ngā mōhiohio anō e pā ana ki ngā hapa i te tatūnga PIN:  https://aka.ms/PINErrors
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\SetUpPinButton:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tautuhitia he PIN
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\PadlockTitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Maukati
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\OkButton:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: ĀE
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\HelpLink:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ:  He pēhea e haumaru ake ai te PIN poto i te kupuhipa roa?
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\HelpHeadline:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: I te mea ka mahi anake tō PIN me tēnei pūrere
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\HelpBody:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i rite ki tēnei mea te kupuhipa, ka whakamahia e koe hei uru ki ngā pūkete maha, he ahurei tō PIN ki tēnei pūrere.  Kāore he take o te PIN ki ngā mūrere mamao.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\ErrorDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mō ētahi atu āwhina, whakapā ki tō kapa tautoko, ki tō papa āwhina IT rānei me ēnei taipitopito.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\ErrorCode:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Waehere hapa:
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\CorrelationId:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: TT Ine pānga:
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\CancelButton:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīpoka mō nāianei
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyTpmError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i te wātea i tēnei wā tonu te Kōwae Pūhara Whirinaki e whakamahia ana ki te whakarite kia haumaru tō PIN i tēnei pūrere. I ētahi wā he āwhina mēnā ka ngana anō, ka taea rānei tēnei te tīpoka me te ngana anō ā muri atu.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodySuccess:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka āhei koe ki te takiuru mā tō PIN ināianei.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyServerError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i taea e mātou te tūhono ki te tūmau hei tatū i tō Pin ināianei tonu. Ka taea e koe te ngana anō, ka taea rānei tēnei te tīpoka me te ngana anō ā muri atu.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyHelloCancel:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me tatū he PIN hei whakamahi i te Windows Hello.  Kāore tēnei e roa.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyHello:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me tatū he PIN hei whakamahi māu ki te whakakapi i te Windows Hello. Kāore pea e hiahiatia e koe, engari ka noho hei pūrua ina hiahiatia.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i taea e mātou te tatū i tō PIN. I ētahi wā he āwhina mēnā ka ngana anō, ka taea rānei tēnei te tīpoka me te ngana anō ā muri atu.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\BodyCancel:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me tatū he PIN hei whakamahi i tēnei pūrere.  Kāore tēnei e roa.
  \enterpriseNgcEnrollment\Body:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He ngāwari noa iho te kupuhipa ki te whānako. Ko tā Windows Hello he tāpae ki a koe tētahi huinga o ētahi take take takirua, ko tō pūrere me ngā waeine koiora, tētahi PIN rānei hei whakakapi mō te kupuhipa hei takiuru ki tō pūrere, ki ō taupānga me ō ratonga. 
  \deviceUser\UserPlaceholder:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Īmēra
  \deviceUser\Title:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tāpiritia he pūkete pūrere
  \deviceUser\PasswordPlaceholder:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kupuhipa
  \deviceUser\NextButton:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: &Panuku
  \deviceUser\LeadText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He pūrere tēnei i tētahi wāhi mahi tiri? Mēnā āe, tāurutia te pūkete ka whakaahei i tētahi kaiwhakamahi kia tāuru ki ngā taupānga pēnei i ngā Microsoft Teams me Skype.
  \deviceUser\Error_UsernameFormat:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tāurutia tō īmēra hei someone@example.com
  \deviceUser\Error_PasswordExpired:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kua mōnehu te kupuhipa mō tēnei pūkete.
  \deviceUser\Error_NoUsername:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tāurutia tō īmēra.
